: "upscaler_model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "upscaler_model"}, {"widget": {"name": "highres_tiling"}, "shape": 7, "name": "highres_tiling", "label": "highres_tiling", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "highres_tiling"}, {"widget": {"name": "tiling_mode"}, "shape": 7, "name": "tiling_mode", "label": "tiling_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "tiling_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "tiling_tiles"}, "shape": 7, "name": "tiling_tiles", "label": "tiling_tiles", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "tiling_tiles"}, {"widget": {"name": "tiling_axis"}, "shape": 7, "name": "tiling_axis", "label": "tiling_axis", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "tiling_axis"}, {"widget": {"name": "highres_tiling_mode"}, "shape": 7, "name": "highres_tiling_mode", "label": "highres_tiling_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "highres_tiling_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "highres_token_chunk"}, "shape": 7, "name": "highres_token_chunk", "label": "highres_token_chunk", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "highres_token_chunk"}, {"widget": {"name": "highres_weight_cache_gb"}, "shape": 7, "name": "highres_weight_cache_gb", "label": "highres_weight_cache_gb", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "highres_weight_cache_gb"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5925, "type": "SelfLiftAvatarH3Sampler", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SelfLiftAvatarH3Sampler"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [20473], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2773.088623046875, 6034.60205078125], "widgets_values": ["<Subject 1> is the character shown in <Picture 1>.\n\n\nCopy the character's head and face exactly as they appear in <Picture 1>: the same face, the same hair, the same neckline and collar, and every feature already visible there, unchanged. \n\nDo not carry over anything the character is holding in <Picture 1>.\nDo not carry over the background or setting of <Picture 1>.\n\n[STYLE]\nThe output matches the style of <Picture 1>. Sharp detail on the eyes, brows and mouth. The style never changes and never drifts between shots. No shadows.\n\n[STAGING]\nSolid light grey seamless backdrop, one flat uniform tone edge to edge, with no gradient, no vignette, no texture and no floor line. Nothing else is in frame. The subject casts no shadow onto the backdrop and does not sit in its own shadow. Soft form shading on the subject itself is fine and should read its shape. Long telephoto lens, near-orthographic.\n\nFraming is a locked-off portrait from the shoulders to the top of the head: the crown sits just below the top edge of frame, the crop line falls across the shoulders. Face square to camera, eyes into the lens, head level and centred. This framing is identical in every shot — the head never changes size or position in frame.\n\nOnly the face changes. The head does not turn, tilt, nod, lean or move at any point. The shoulders and body are completely frozen. There is no wind, no hair movement, no breathing, no sway, no secondary motion of any kind. Lighting is identical in every shot.\n\nEvery expression is a microexpression: the smallest movement that still reads clearly. Only the brows, eyelids, gaze and mouth corners move, and only slightly. The face underneath stays relaxed and smooth in every shot — no forehead creases, no crow's feet, no crinkling at the corners of the eyes, no deepened lines beside the nose or mouth, no nose wrinkling, no squinting, no bulging or straining. Nothing is exaggerated, theatrical or posed. Eyes stay open and into the lens unless a beat below says otherwise.\n\nEach expression appears fully formed and is then held perfectly still, like a freeze frame. Changes between expressions happen as a single hard snap lasting under 0.1 seconds, with no easing, no blending, no in-between expression, no cut and no dissolve.\n\n[0-0.83 seconds] Expression 1 is already fully formed on the very first frame: GENTLE SMILE. Mouth corners lifted a small amount, lips closed and soft, a quiet warmth in the eyes without narrowing them, eyelids at their normal open position, brows relaxed and level. Skin around the eyes and mouth stays completely smooth. Content and calm, not amused, not beaming. Held dead still.\n\n[0.83-1.67 seconds] Snap to Expression 2: SAD. Inner corners of the brows lifted very slightly, upper eyelids a little heavy, gaze dropped a fraction while the eyes stay open, mouth corners barely turned down, lips closed and soft. Quiet and withdrawn, not crying, not grimacing. Held dead still.\n\n[1.67-2.5 seconds] Snap to Expression 3: LAUGHING. Head level and square to camera. Eyes closed with the lids curved in easy relaxed crescents, mouth open in a natural unforced laugh with the upper teeth showing, brows slightly raised, cheeks softly lifted. Skin stays smooth — no squeezing, no nose wrinkle, no strain. A light amused laugh, mouth only moderately open. Held dead still.\n\n[2.5-3.33 seconds] Snap to Expression 4: ANGRY. Brows lowered slightly and drawn a little inward with no crease forming between them, gaze fixed, steady and cool, faint tension in the upper lids, lips closed and lightly pressed together. Displeased and controlled, not glaring, not snarling, jaw not clenched. Held dead still.\n\n[3.33-4.17 seconds] Snap to Expression 5: SURPRISED. Brows lifted with the forehead staying smooth, eyes a touch wider than normal, lips just parted. Caught off guard for a fraction of a second, not shocked — the jaw does not drop and the eyes do not go wide. Held dead still.\n\n[4.17-5.0 seconds] Snap to Expression 6: CONCERN. Brows drawn slightly together with the inner corners raised a small amount, forehead smooth, eyes fully open, alert and attentive with the gaze level and directly into the lens, lips closed and lightly pressed. Worried about something in front of them, engaged and outward-facing — not sad, not withdrawn, not afraid. Held dead still.\n\n[CAMERA] Completely locked off and static for the entire clip. No orbit, no zoom, no push in, no dolly, no pan, no tilt, no roll, no handheld shake, no motion blur, no cuts, no dissolves.\n[AUDIO] Silence. No music, no room tone, no voices."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 5924, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [20488, 20489], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "LATENT", "links": [20491], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [435.9624938964844, 543.3773193359375], "pos": [-2459.610107421875, 5411.615234375], "widgets_values": ["", 768, 1344, 124, "max"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 20483, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 20482, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_vae", "link": 20481, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 278, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "label": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_video_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "label": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_video_audio_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "label": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_audio_0"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 20473, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "local